# P2 swept 0 -> 255 twice: once on the saw swarm (P1 255: unison, chorus, a wide cluster, then inharmonic membrane
# ratios) and once on the particles (P1 70: pings on the note scattering into a cluster, then bell-like).
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 2.0
track lead
preset 255 0 0 64 255 30 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 A3 22 120
sweep p2 0 255 1 21
param p1 70 24
param p2 0 24
note 24 A4 22 120
sweep p2 0 255 25 45
expect sound 0 46
expect idle 64
expect peak_below -4
